sing air will cool and stop rising. That's why mountains are cold, and why your upstairs is hot only because the entire house is being heated from below (ground floor) and above (roof) simultaneously. In short: - **Hot air balloon:** contained, with burner adding heat → stays hot and rises. - **Free air in the atmosphere:** no burner → cools with altitude. - **Air in your house:** tiny altitude, no expansion cooling, plus roof heating → stays warm upstairs.
